<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes" />
  <title>Super Tela | Streaming em Alta Definição</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts premium + fallback -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:opsz,wght@14..32,300;14..32,400;14..32,500;14..32,600;14..32,700&family=Syne:wght@600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Font Awesome 6 (ícones profissionais) -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background: #0a0c1a;
      color: #f0f3ff;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    /* fundo dinâmico com gradiente e grão sutil */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(10, 20, 50, 0.9), #020617 90%);
      z-index: -2;
    }

    body::after {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI0MCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI0MCIgdmlld0JveD0iMCAwIDQwIDQwIj48cGF0aCBmaWxsPSIjZmZmZmZmIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMDMiIGQ9Ik0wIDBoNDB2NDBIMHoiLz48L3N2Zz4=');
      opacity: 0.3;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    /* glassmorphism + header moderno */
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 3rem;
      background: rgba(5, 7, 20, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 200;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .logo i {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #00f2fe;
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px #00e0ff;
    }

    .logo h1 {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #00f2fe, #a66eff);
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    /* navegação refinada */
    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #eef5ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: 0.25s;
      position: relative;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    nav a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -6px;
      left: 0;
      width: 0%;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, cyan, #a759ff);
      transition: 0.3s ease;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: cyan;
    }

    nav a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* hero section premium */
    .hero {
      min-height: 85vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 960px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 56px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
      animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 4.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff, #85ffff, #b27aff);
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #ccd9ff;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
    }

    .btn-glow {
      padding: 14px 38px;
      border-radius: 60px;
      border: none;
      background: linear-gradient(98deg, #00c6ff, #8a2be2);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 195, 255, 0.3);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .btn-glow i {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .btn-glow:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.7);
      background: linear-gradient(98deg, #16d9ff, #9b4dff);
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(40px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    /* titles com estilo neon */
    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin: 60px 40px 20px 40px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e0f0ff, #5efff0);
      background-clip: text;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
      letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      border-left: 5px solid #0ff;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .movies-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
      padding: 0 40px 60px;
    }

    /* card premium cinema */
    .movie-card {
      background: rgba(12, 15, 35, 0.65);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-radius: 32px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.4, 1.1);
      position: relative;
    }

    .movie-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-12px);
      border-color: rgba(0, 244, 255, 0.6);
      box-shadow: 0 28px 40px -12px rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.3);
    }

    .card-img {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 340px;
    }

    .card-img img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }

    .movie-card:hover .card-img img {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .badge-pro {
      position: absolute;
      top: 18px;
      right: 18px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 40px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: cyan;
      border: 1px solid cyan;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .card-content {
      padding: 22px 20px 24px;
    }

    .card-content h3 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .card-content p {
      color: #b7c2ff;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .meta-info {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: cyan;
    }

    .player-container {
      padding: 20px 40px 70px;
    }

    .player-wrapper {
      border-radius: 32px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 35px -12px black;
      background: #000;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 560px;
      display: block;
      border: none;
    }

    /* chamada p/ nova série */
    .series-banner {
      margin: 20px 40px 40px;
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, rgba(0, 30, 60, 0.7), rgba(25, 0, 60, 0.8));
      border-radius: 44px;
      padding: 30px 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }

    .series-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .series-text p {
      color: #cbd5ff;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      border: 2px solid cyan;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      border-radius: 60px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: white;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: cyan;
      color: #0a0c1a;
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px cyan;
      border-color: transparent;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.2);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #9aa7e0;
    }

    .social-links {
      margin-top: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 24px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .social-links i {
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.2s;
      color: #bac8ff;
    }

    .social-links i:hover {
      color: cyan;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px cyan;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      header {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
        padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      }
      nav {
        gap: 1.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }
      .section-header {
        margin: 40px 20px 15px 20px;
      }
      .movies-grid, .player-container {
        padding-left: 20px;
        padding-right: 20px;
      }
      iframe {
        height: 280px;
      }
      .series-banner {
        margin: 20px 20px 40px;
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">
    <i class="fas fa-tv"></i>
    <h1>SUPER TELA</h1>
  </div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#inicio"><i class="fas fa-home" style="margin-right: 6px;"></i>Início</a>
    <a href="#filmes"><i class="fas fa-film"></i> Filmes</a>
    <a href="#series"><i class="fas fa-play-circle"></i> Séries</a>
    <a href="#player"><i class="fas fa-video"></i> Player Ultra</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section id="inicio" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Super Tela <span style="color:cyan;">4K</span></h1>
    <p>
      A revolução do entretenimento digital. Qualidade cinematográfica, áudio imersivo e uma experiência futurista.
      Assista aos melhores lançamentos, sucessos e clássicos em um só lugar.
    </p>
    <button class="btn-glow" id="heroBtn"><i class="fas fa-play"></i> Explorar agora</button>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- seção filmes em destaque-->
<div class="section-header" id="filmes">
  <div class="section-title"><i class="fas fa-fire" style="margin-right: 12px; color: cyan;"></i> Em Destaque · Ultra HD</div>
  <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; background: rgba(0,255,255,0.1); padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 40px;">⭐ + de 80 títulos premium</div>
</div>

<section class="movies-grid">
  <div class="movie-card">
    <div class="card-img">
      <span class="badge-pro"><i class="fas fa-diamond"></i> 4K HDR</span>
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531259683007-016a7b7fc3a3?q=80&w=1887&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Filme Akira Revival">
    </div>
    <div class="card-content">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-robot"></i> Akira Revival</h3>
      <p>Em um Tóquio cyberpunk, um guerreiro descobre segredos que podem colapsar a realidade digital.</p>
      <div class="meta-info"><span><i class="far fa-clock"></i> 2h 18min</span><span><i class="fas fa-star" style="color:gold;"></i> 9.2</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="movie-card">
    <div class="card-img">
      <span class="badge-pro"><i class="fas fa-microchip"></i> IMAX</span>
